description = "A twisted mass of thorny vines that has gained sentience through absorbing the life force of countless victims. Its body bristles with razor-sharp barbs that drip with paralytic toxin. Where it walks, nothing grows again - the soil becomes barren and poisoned. It speaks through the rustling of its leaves, whispering the last words of those it has consumed."
